'''KRÜ Esports''' is an [[:Category:Argentina|Argentine]] organization focused on the esports and content creation scenes with the goal of bringing this world to a wider audience with the support of Manchester City, Atlético de Madrid, Barcelona and Argentina striker [[wikipedia:Sergio Agüero|Sergio Agüero]] as founder and helping with the connection between the traditional and virtual sports scene.

