==Trivia==
*They are the only team to have played at every international VALORANT tournament in 2021 and 2022.
*In 2023, despite going winless in the Regular Season of [[VCT/2023/Americas_League|VCT Americas 2023]], '''KRU Esports''' managed to qualify for [[VCT/2023/Champions|Champions 2023]] by winning the [[VCT/2023/Americas_League/Last_Chance_Qualifier|Last Chance Qualifier]] without losing a series.

